{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>story</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse_ver2__9_.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I received a letter I had no memory of at all.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up in an unfamiliar house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game begins in a place that evokes both nostalgia\u2014like a friend's home you visited long ago buried deep within your memories\u2014and a creeping sense of unease.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Begin Your Exploration</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse_ver2_nontext__3_.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/BloodVomit.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange items are scattered at your feet and around the room, incongruous with their surroundings yet vital to uncovering the story. In this game, collecting items isn\u2019t your only goal\u2014you must consume them and <strong>\u201cvomit blood\u201d</strong> as a key mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By <strong>consuming items</strong> and absorbing their essence, you gradually gain abilities that bring you closer to the truth, even as your strength wanes. In this game, your HP gauge is not directly tied to survival or clearing the game. It carries an entirely different significance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Something is approaching\u2026</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse_ver2_nontext__1_.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This is a VR horror game.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of locomotion are available: smooth movement using the joystick and teleportation (coming soon).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose smooth movement for a more immersive experience, or teleportation if you prefer to reduce motion sickness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338670?t=1743665281","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338670?t=1743665281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/148299d367943158a25d311ec5e773283c5bb12a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743665281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/148299d367943158a25d311ec5e773283c5bb12a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743665281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"It includes a scene in which a foreign object is swallowed and blood is vomited."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>story</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse_ver2__9_.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I received a letter I had no memory of at all.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up in an unfamiliar house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game begins in a place that evokes both nostalgia\u2014like a friend's home you visited long ago buried deep within your memories\u2014and a creeping sense of unease.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Begin Your Exploration</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse_ver2_nontext__3_.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/BloodVomit.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange items are scattered at your feet and around the room, incongruous with their surroundings yet vital to uncovering the story. In this game, collecting items isn\u2019t your only goal\u2014you must consume them and <strong>\u201cvomit blood\u201d</strong> as a key mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By <strong>consuming items</strong> and absorbing their essence, you gradually gain abilities that bring you closer to the truth, even as your strength wanes. In this game, your HP gauge is not directly tied to survival or clearing the game. It carries an entirely different significance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Something is approaching\u2026</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/extras/muse_ver2_nontext__1_.gif?t=1743665281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This is a VR horror game.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of locomotion are available: smooth movement using the joystick and teleportation (coming soon).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose smooth movement for a more immersive experience, or teleportation if you prefer to reduce motion sickness.</p>","developers":["Serious tone Club"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/header.jpg?t=1743665281","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098621,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098621/movie480.mp4?t=1743606244","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098621/movie_max.mp4?t=1743606244"},"name":"MUSE / Second Trailer ver.1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098621/042865cd1ce97e6a6f61db1aae65096f8f18e7d0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743606244","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098621/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743606244","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098621/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743606244"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257121400,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121400/movie480.mp4?t=1743606247","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121400/movie_max.mp4?t=1743606247"},"name":"MUSE / First Trailer ver.2 English","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121400/cf3c864b71dd5057f42106f0cfeb7ec298caee3e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743606247","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121400/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743606247","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121400/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743606247"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257089183,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089183/movie480.mp4?t=1743606310","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089183/movie_max.mp4?t=1743606310"},"name":"MUSE / First Trailer ver.2 Japanease","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257089183/09f61cfc8